/ Stage 10a: a plugin loaded with code.load registers its own types, reached like a built-in.
/ TypeProvider.dll declares "money" (TestFixtures/TypeProvider/Money.cs), copied next to this test.
Start
- code.load Path=TypeProvider.dll
- set %types% = %!app.type.list%
- any %types% where "name" == "money", write to %joined%
- assert %joined% is true, "the plugin's type joined the app's list"
- assert %!app.type.money.name% equals "money", "and is reached like a built-in"
